    "body": "Not sure I understand the motivation to avoid the flat tree, but since we haven't implemented the :heading pseudo-class yet then I guess we don't have to worry about breaking any websites, so I'm ok with this change.\n\nI wouldn't want to set a precedent that we should avoid the flat tree when sites are relying on it for dialog initial focus for example: https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/9245#issuecomment-4201325702",
